  "name": "Revision pin",
  "definition": "The exact immutable revision of a mutable relation endpoint that the relation was last confirmed against. It preserves what the author read: an unchanged criterion or story obligation can carry forward visibly, while a changed obligation makes the relation stale until it is repinned. It is not a Git commit pin.",
